#: ../../developer-api/webhooks.md:52 cd29960e56624ba68793633c3f5604cb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A delivery succeeds on any `2xx`. Failures retry with exponential backoff"
" (up to 6 attempts); an endpoint that keeps failing is auto-disabled. "
"Inspect recent attempts with `GET /api/v1/webhooks/{id}`."
msgstr ""
"ينجح التسليم عند أي استجابة `2xx`. تُعاد محاولة الإخفاقات بتراجع أسّي "
"(exponential backoff) (حتى 6 محاولات)؛ ويُعطَّل تلقائيًا أي طرف نهاية "
"يستمر في الفشل. افحص المحاولات الأخيرة باستخدام `GET "
"/api/v1/webhooks/{id}`."

#: ../../developer-api/webhooks.md:54 d19f5b428e16467abcb6bf4d466fe37a
msgid ""
"Deliveries are at-least-once: a timeout on our side after your handler "
"committed will be retried. Use the `id` field to de-duplicate."
msgstr ""
"التسليمات مضمونة مرة واحدة على الأقل: انتهاء المهلة من جانبنا بعد أن "
"يكون معالجك قد التزم بالتغيير ستتم إعادة محاولته. استخدم حقل `id` "
"لإزالة التكرار."

#: ../../developer-api/webhooks.md:56 89a0701681cd447f9cd9183b0282816a
msgid "Verifying signatures"
msgstr "التحقق من التوقيعات"

#: ../../developer-api/webhooks.md:58 58878d26ea9d4a25b8906f991f121d15
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The signature is `HMAC-SHA256` of `${timestamp}.${rawBody}` keyed by your"
" endpoint `secret`, hex-encoded:"
msgstr ""
"التوقيع هو `HMAC-SHA256` لـ `${timestamp}.${rawBody}` باستخدام مفتاح "
"`secret` الخاص بطرف النهاية لديك، مُرمَّز سداسيًا عشريًا (hex-encoded):"

#: ../../developer-api/webhooks.md:60 a9828edc9f8045719eade716bf890b1c
msgid ""
"import { createHmac, timingSafeEqual } from 'crypto';\n"
"\n"
"function verify(secret, header, rawBody, toleranceSec = 300) {\n"
"  const parts = Object.fromEntries(header.split(',').map((kv) => "
"kv.split('=')));\n"
"  const t = Number(parts.t);\n"
"  if (Math.abs(Date.now() / 1000 - t) > toleranceSec) return false; // "
"replay guard\n"
"  const expected = createHmac('sha256', "
"secret).update(`${t}.${rawBody}`).digest('hex');\n"
"  const a = Buffer.from(expected),\n"
"    b = Buffer.from(parts.v1);\n"
"  return a.length === b.length && timingSafeEqual(a, b);\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"import { createHmac, timingSafeEqual } from 'crypto';\n"
"\n"
"function verify(secret, header, rawBody, toleranceSec = 300) {\n"
"  const parts = Object.fromEntries(header.split(',').map((kv) => "
"kv.split('=')));\n"
"  const t = Number(parts.t);\n"
"  if (Math.abs(Date.now() / 1000 - t) > toleranceSec) return false; // "
"replay guard\n"
"  const expected = createHmac('sha256', "
"secret).update(`${t}.${rawBody}`).digest('hex');\n"
"  const a = Buffer.from(expected),\n"
"    b = Buffer.from(parts.v1);\n"
"  return a.length === b.length && timingSafeEqual(a, b);\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../developer-api/webhooks.md:75 019a4d9a884d4d11b548a06828bc3c09
msgid ""
"Verify the signature **and** the timestamp tolerance before trusting a "
"payload, and compute the HMAC over the **raw** request body — not over a "
"re-serialised parsed object, whose byte-for-byte output will differ and "
"fail to match."
msgstr ""
"تحقق من التوقيع **و**تفاوت الطابع الزمني قبل الوثوق بأي حمولة، واحسب "
"HMAC على جسم الطلب **الخام** — وليس على كائن مُحلَّل أُعيد تسلسله، والذي "
"سيختلف ناتجه بايتًا بايت ويفشل في المطابقة."

